,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-22T10:28:13","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"a1f8e44c-a65b-4757-948c-5ff8b554ea7d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151257154,"PostDateInt":1789990051000,"PostDate":"2026-09-21T19:27:31","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"渠道运营经理","OrgId":1628030,"Org":"EBG","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·杭州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.代理商体系搭建：独立负责全国 / 区域代理商体系从 0 到 1 的搭建，包括代理商招募标准制定、合作模式设计（如分销、经销、授权合作等）、渠道布局规划，完成代理商网络的开拓与优化，确保渠道覆盖的全面性与合理性。​\n2.代理商全周期管理：建立代理商准入、培训、扶持、淘汰的全流程管理机制，定期与代理商进行深度沟通，了解其业务进展、需求痛点，提供针对性的资源支持与运营指导，解决合作过程中的各类问题，维护稳定的合作关系。​\n3.考核与激励制度制定：结合公司业务目标与渠道特性，制定清晰、可落地的代理商考核体系（如销售额、提货数、回款率、市场拓展率、客户满意度等核心指标），设计富有吸引力的激励机制（如返点、奖金、资源倾斜、荣誉认证等），并根据市场变化与业务发展动态优化制度，激发代理商积极性。​\n4.渠道业绩达成：设定渠道销售目标并分解至各代理商，跟踪目标达成进度，分析渠道业绩数据（如销量、增长率、市场份额等），识别业绩短板并制定改进方案，确保整体渠道业绩超额完成。​\n5.渠道生态维护：调研行业渠道动态、竞争对手渠道策略，输出市场分析报告，为公司渠道战略调整提供依据；组织代理商会议、培训活动、营销推广联动等，提升代理商专业能力与品牌认同感，构建良性互动的渠道生态。​\n6.跨部门协同：与销售、市场、产品、财务等部门紧密协作，协调资源支持渠道业务开展，确保产品供应、营销活动、回款流程等高效推进。","Require":"工作经验：​\n1.具备5 年以上渠道运营相关工作经验，有完整的代理商体系搭建、管理及制度制定经验，能够独立主导渠道项目落地。​\n2.优先考虑海康威视、大华股份、阿里巴巴、大疆创新等大厂渠道运营、代理商管理相关工作背景者。​\n专业能力：​\n1.精通渠道运营逻辑，熟悉代理商招募、培训、考核、激励的全流程管理方法，能够根据业务需求设计针对性的渠道策略与制度。​\n2.具备较强的数据分析能力，能通过渠道数据洞察问题并提出优化方案，驱动业绩增长；有成功提升渠道销量、拓展渠道覆盖的案例者优先。​\n3.具备优秀的商务谈判与沟通协调能力，能够与代理商建立深度信任的合作关系，高效解决合作中的各类问题。​\n综合素质：​\n1.具备强烈的目标感与结果导向，抗压能力强，能够在复杂的市场环境中推动渠道业务达成。​\n2.逻辑思维清晰，做事严谨有条理，具备良好的团队协作精神，能够跨部门高效协同推进工作。​\n3.本科及以上学历，市场营销、工商管理、商务管理等相关专业优先。研究生优先。","ClassificationOne":"市场类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-21T19:27:31","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"b5137a69-f257-4ce1-9886-28484d73729f","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151257150,"PostDateInt":1789989703000,"PostDate":"2026-09-21T19:21:43","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01